# The address field's tap raises the keyboard; a tap on the page drops it (the window server's IME line).
id: keyboard-address
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R2
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
chrome address
expect keyboard up 8
tap-at 384 300
expect keyboard down 8
